{"id":"chf-sold-homes-landlords","title":"Sold nursing homes: who owns the building, and since when","question":"When a case home changed hands, did the building pass to a company of the buyer's own?","finding":"47 of the 47 sold homes have a facility export. At 33 the current property owner dates from the same day as the current licensee; at 1 (The Ridge Post-Acute) the property owner is among the companies the export lists as owning the licensee, and at 3 it is the licensee itself. Of all 79 homes' exports, 36 homes hold a \"Patient Needs Waiver of 2.4\" and 17 a \"Workforce Shortage Waiver of 2.4 only\" for July 2026 to June 2027.","how":"Each Cal Health Find facility export (saved 21 November 2026) gives the licensee, the property owner and the companies with any share in the licensee, each with dates. \"Same day\": the current property owner's start date equals the current licensee's. \"Among the owners\": the property owner's name appears in the export's list of owning companies or its ownership structure (exact text).","limits":"A new property company on the day of a sale is the usual shape of a purchase split into an operating company and a property company, and need not be related to the buyer. A name missing from the ownership list does not show the companies are unrelated: the export lists owners of the licensee, not of the property company. Where an earlier property owner is an individual, the name is not shown.","tier":"OFFICIAL","columns":[{"k":"home","t":"Nursing home","type":"org"},{"k":"city","t":"City","type":"text"},{"k":"soldOn","t":"Changed owner (federal file)","type":"date"},{"k":"buyer","t":"Buyer (federal file)","type":"org"},{"k":"licenseeSince","t":"Current licensee since","type":"date"},{"k":"propertyOwner","t":"Property owner now","type":"org"},{"k":"ownerSince","t":"Since","type":"date"},{"k":"earlierOwner","t":"Earlier property owner","type":"text"},{"k":"sameDay","t":"Same day as licensee","type":"text"},{"k":"inOwners","t":"Among the